 i just  i don't know i feel i'm really really  really happy right now which  um i feel like i earned because it took  me a long time to get here and also  um i just feel really grateful and  blessed and i know there's a lot of  women that don't have the luxury i do to  be at home when you want to writing a  column and doing things like this and i  feel really lucky and really  just really blessed right now

